## 2026-04-24 - US-007
- What was implemented: Added `openLocalDb(did)` to `src/client/db/sqlite-init.ts`. In test mode (toggled via `setTestMode(true, wasmUrl)`), it opens a `:memory:` DB and runs `SCHEMA_SQL`. In production, it uses OPFS-SAH-pool VFS and throws `OPFSUnavailableError` if OPFS is unavailable. Tests in `test/sqlite-init.ts` verify feeds/items tables, indexes, idempotency, and the error class.
- Files changed:
